{
  "rule": "RULE R-EQ (frozen before any new measurement):\n\nFrom the certified W-vs-C pairs, group by (n, density).  Within each\nnonempty stratum, order the cells by sha256 of the ORIGINAL FORMULA\n(ascending, hex string order) and take the first.  Ties -- impossible for\ndistinct formulas -- would break on the cell id.  Strata are visited in\nascending (n, density).  If more than `max_instances` strata existed, the\nfirst `max_instances` in that order would be taken; here 7 <= 9, so all\nstrata are represented.\n\nThe ordering key is the formula hash, which is fixed by (n, alpha, k) and\nis independent of every outcome: of the size of the existing advantage, of\nexpected runtime, and of any previous equal-size attempt.\n",
